# Side-effect hooks retain generated SMW collision. SMWDisX 3390ee1 bank_00
# HandlePlayerPhysics ($D5F2) reads native gameplay input before reaching the
# later UpdatePlayerSpritePosition ($DC2D) velocity seam. The early hook owns
# pad suppression; DC2D commits velocity, then HandlePlayerLevelCollision
# ($E92B), then PlayerState00_00CD36 ($CD36) joins ordinary flow. Restrict M1X1.
@hook HandlePlayerPhysics -> SmwFalconBeforePlayerPhysics M1X1
@hook UpdatePlayerSpritePosition -> SmwFalconBeforePhysics M1X1
@hook PlayerState00_00CD36 -> SmwFalconAfterPhysics M1X1
